{"id":"nonostante","lemma":"nonostante","pos":"prep","rank":1094,"glosses":["in spite of; notwithstanding","despite"],"ipa":"/no.nosˈtan.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-nonostante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Siamo uscite nonostante la pioggia.","en":"We went out in spite of the rain.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"exit, way out","l":"uscita"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"rain"}]},{"text":"Perché importa nonostante tutto?","en":"Why does it matter anyhow?","words":[{"g":"why / because"},{"g":"to be important","l":"importare"},null,{"g":"everything, all"}]},{"text":"Nonostante fosse molto freddo, sono uscito.","en":"Even though it was very cold, I went out.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"the cold"},{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"to go out, leave, exit","l":"uscire"}]},{"text":"È venuto al lavoro nonostante la malattia.","en":"He went to work in spite of his illness.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"coming"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"work"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"illness"}]},{"text":"Nonostante sia anziano, è forte.","en":"Although he is very old, he is strong.","words":[null,{"g":"both ... and .."},{"g":"elder, senior"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"strong"}]}]}